  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AfDB Governance Trust Fund</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AfDB Governance Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med denna Trust Fund &#xe4;r att erbjuda flexibel finansiering f&#xf6;r  sm&#xe5; innovativa och strategiska insatser inom god samh&#xe4;llsstyrning i   enlighet med AfDB&apos;s Governance Strategy, dvs med fokus p&#xe5; transparens och ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande inom offentlig finansiell styrning och          ekonomisk samh&#xe4;llstyrning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the GTF is to provide financing to support the  implementation of the AfDB&apos;s Governance Strategy. The GTF provides    untied grants to support innovative ideas to promote good economic  and financial governance, transparency and accountability in the use  of public funds for the benefit of member countries through consulting services and technical assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Governance Trust Fund is to assist the Bank&#x2019;s Regional MemberCountries (RMCs) to build capable and responsive States by strengthening transparency and accountability in the management of public resources. Specifically, the GTF will support innovative ideas in the field of economic and financial governance that demonstrate potential to promote change and achieve results within the context of the Governance Action Plan(GAP).</narrative>
  </description>
